This interface shows all features of this device as follows: "Browser History",  "eBook",  "Music", "Video", "Photo“, "Record", "Explorer", "settings" Select the desire function, then  enter.

<PIC:Manual13_3>
{{image description: EReader main menu screen showing Browser History, eBook, Music, Video, Photo, Record, Explorer, and Settings with icons, item numbers, battery icon, and time 00:28.}}

Adjusting the volume:   Press the "Up/Down" key at the Navigation or Up/Prev  page, Down/Next page key to adjust the volume.  Play/Pause:   Press the "Play / Pause" key to pause or continue play.  Forward / Backward/Previous/Next:   Press and hold “left direction” key to  backward the music and “right direction” key to forward the music. Press and release “left  direction” key to go to previous audio file and “right direction” key to go to next audio file.  Music play mode:   There are five audio playing mode: "Repeat Mode", "Play  Mode"," MS EQ", "EQ Sel" and "User EQ setup". When in Music mode, press “M” then  select desire mode that you wish to made adjustment.  

<PIC:Manual13_8>
{{image description: Music playback screen with a settings menu open. The track list includes Better Than Today, Kylie Minogue, and Aphrodite; menu items include Repeat Mode, Play Mode, MSEQ, EQ Sel, and User EQ Setup.}}

Go to Photo and press "M" button to enter Photo mode. This device support JPEG and  BMP image format.  Photo previous and Next:  Press the "left / right" navigation keys to go to  Previous or Next photo.  Photo Rotation:  Press the "Play/Pause" key to rotate the photo in counter wise  sequence.  Zoom in / out:  Press these key to zoom in or out of photo.  Note: some large size files require more time to rotate than the small size files.  And it also require more time to load the photos into the photo viewer.

<PIC:Manual13_10>
{{image description: Black-and-white video or photo of soccer players celebrating in a stadium crowd.}}

Select the "Record" in the main menu, click "M" button to enter the voice record mode.

<PIC:Manual13_11>
{{image description: Record screen with a large microphone graphic, Ready status, timer 00:00:00, bit rate text, a red record button, and filename VREC006.WAV.}}

Press the "Play/Pause" button to start the recording, press it again to pause the recording,  press the "HOME" to stop the recording.  After you done with the recording you will be prompted to ask if want to save into the  device. Please select “YES” or “NOT” by pressing the “M” key.

